      "changelog": "\u003ch3\u003eAdded\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay progress bar on JEI recipes for the Solderer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eChanged\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated Forge to 2282.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated JEI version.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated MCMultiPart version.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou can now shift click Grid Filters into a Grid instead of manually inserting them.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou can now use up and down arrows to scroll through Grid search history.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShift clicking patterns in the Pattern Grid now puts the patterns in the pattern slot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStorage Monitors don\u0027t render any quantity text when no item is specified to monitor anymore.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe Solderer inventory isn\u0027t sided anymore.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmall performance improvement: only sort the storages when needed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFixed\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed bug where disks in Disk Drive didn\u0027t respect access type or void excess stacks option.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed crash in Disk Manipulator.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed oredict not working.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed Grid crash.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed Fluid Grid not formatting large quantities correctly.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n",
